      <h2 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.7rem; font-weight: 800; line-height: 1.35; margin-bottom: 18px;">Statutory RTO Paperwork, Transit Marine Insurance &amp; Delivery Handover for Relocation Services India</h2>
      <div style="font-size: 1.02rem; line-height: 1.8; color: #cbd5e1;">
	<p>When it comes to relocating vehicles or providing services across India, certain documents are necessary to ensure a smooth and hassle-free process. Below are the essential paperwork requirements:</p>

	<p>The Vehicle Registration Certificate (RC) is an official document issued by the local transport authority verifying ownership of a vehicle. To relocate a vehicle, you need a self-attested copy of the RC. This copy should be duly signed and stamped by the vehicle owner to confirm its authenticity.</p>

	<p>The PUC certificate is a periodic check conducted by local authorities to ensure that vehicles comply with pollution control standards. For relocating a vehicle, it is essential to provide a self-attested copy of the current PUC certificate. This document verifies that the vehicle is in compliance with environmental regulations.</p>

	<p>Protecting your vehicle during relocation is crucial. Provide a valid insurance certificate that covers the vehicle during transit. This certificate ensures financial protection in case of any damages or accidents during the relocation process.</p>

	<p style="font-size: 1.04rem; line-height: 1.75; color: #f1f5f9; font-weight: 500; margin-bottom: 12px;">The Indian Bureau of Mines (IBA) plays a vital role in regulating the transport of minerals and minerals products across India.</p>
<ul style="list-style: none; padding-left: 0; margin: 16px 0 20px 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px;"><li style="display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07); padding: 10px 14px; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 0.92rem; line-height: 1.55; color: #cbd5e1;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 4px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.9rem;"></i><span>For seamless vehicle relocation, you should obtain an IBA-approved consignment bill of lading (BOL).</span></li><li style="display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07); padding: 10px 14px; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 0.92rem; line-height: 1.55; color: #cbd5e1;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 4px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.9rem;"></i><span>This document serves as a contract between the vehicle owner and the transporter, outlining the details of the relocation and ensuring a reliable and safe transport.</span></li></ul>

	<p style="font-size: 1.04rem; line-height: 1.75; color: #f1f5f9; font-weight: 500; margin-bottom: 12px;">To provide comprehensive protection for your vehicle during transportation, it is recommended to opt for a 100% declared value marine transit insurance.</p>
<ul style="list-style: none; padding-left: 0; margin: 16px 0 20px 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px;"><li style="display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07); padding: 10px 14px; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 0.92rem; line-height: 1.55; color: #cbd5e1;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 4px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.9rem;"></i><span>This insurance covers the vehicle's value completely, ensuring that you receive compensation for any damages or losses during relocation.</span></li><li style="display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07); padding: 10px 14px; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 0.92rem; line-height: 1.55; color: #cbd5e1;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 4px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.9rem;"></i><span>The insurance company will provide a self-attested copy of the insurance policy, which should be included in your paperwork.</span></li></ul>
	<h3>Additionally, you should consider:</h3>
	<div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr)); gap: 20px; margin-top: 24px;">
  <div style="background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.75); border: 1.5px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 14px; padding: 24px 20px; box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.35); transition: transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;">
