    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">This letter confirms the vehicle owner's consent for the vehicle to be relocated and serves as proof of ownership. It is essential for the transporter to have this document to ensure a smooth and legal transportation process.</p>
