    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">To verify the legitimacy of the transporter, obtain a self-attested copy of their registration certificate. This document confirms that the transporter is registered with the appropriate authorities and meets the necessary criteria to operate in the transportation industry.</p>
